lishments in a more structured and impactful way.  For example, instead of saying 'designed and implemented RESTful APIs', you could say 'Designed and implemented RESTful APIs using Java Spring Boot and Angular, which resulted in [quantifiable outcome], such as improved performance or reduced development time.'", "Quantify your achievements whenever possible.  For example, instead of saying 'significantly improved productivity', you could say 'improved productivity by [percentage]'.", "Use action verbs to make your descriptions more dynamic and engaging. For example, instead of 'designed and deployed', use 'architected and deployed' or 'developed and launched'."], 'title': 'Experience'}, {'ats_match': 90, 'description': 'The listing of your skills is well-organized and comprehensive. It clearly shows your proficiency in programming languages, frameworks, and tools commonly used in software development. The inclusion of specific technologies like Kafka and Git demonstrates your expertise in modern development practices.', 'recommendations': ['Consider grouping your skills into categories, such as Programming Languages, Frameworks and Libraries, Databases, Tools and Platforms. This can improve readability and make it easier for recruiters to quickly identify your key skills.'], 'title': 'Skills'}, {'ats_match': 85, 'description': 'This section clearly outlines your academic background and the degree you earned in Computer Science from the Catholic University College, Ghana. ', 'recommendations': ['Consider adding any relevant coursework or projects you completed during your studies that demonstrate your technical skills and abilities. You can also mention any relevant certifications or awards you have received.'], 'title': 'Education'}, {'ats_match': None, 'description': 'Overall, your resume is well-structured and informative, showcasing a strong foundation in software development. To further enhance its impact, focus on quantifying your achievements, using action verbs to make your descriptions more dynamic, and organizing your skills into categories. Consider tailoring your resume to the specific job requirements for each application.  ', 'recommendations': ['Use a professional resume template and ensure consistent formatting throughout.  Pay attention to font size, margins, and spacing to create a visually appealing and easy-to-read document. ', 'Proofread your resume carefully for any grammatical errors or typos. Consider having a friend or colleague review it as well.'], 'title': 'Overall Recommendations'}], 'overall_feedback': "Olusegun, your resume showcases a strong foundation in software development, particularly within the fintech and AI domains. You've demonstrated a  commitment to learning new technologies and delivering impactful solutions. The breadth of your experience and your ability to work across various technologies and methodologies is impressive. However, there are opportunities to refine the content and organization of your resume to make it even more effective in attracting the right opportunities."}, 'file_uri': 'gs://genaiq_cloudbuild/uploads/Olusegun_Tewogbade.pdf', 'filename': 'Olusegun_Tewogbade.pdf'}>
