to elaborate on your accomplishments, providing context, action, result, and impact.', 'Consider adding a brief description of each company to provide context for potential employers.']}, {'title': 'Skills', 'description': 'This section effectively lists your programming languages, frameworks, and tools. It clearly demonstrates your technical proficiency.', 'ats_match': '95%', 'recommendations': ['Consider organizing your skills by category (e.g., Programming Languages, Frameworks, Tools) for improved readability.', "Highlight any specific certifications or specialized skills that align with the positions you're targeting."]}, {'title': 'Education', 'description': 'You clearly state your degree and institution, but consider adding a few relevant coursework or projects to further demonstrate your skills and knowledge.', 'ats_match': '80%', 'recommendations': ['Highlight any relevant coursework or projects that demonstrate your skills and knowledge in areas like fintech, AI, or mobile app development.', 'Consider adding a brief description of any academic achievements or awards.']}]}
