2024-09-05 16:33:49,931 - app - INFO - Analysis result: {'overall_roast': "Alright, alright, alright! Let's break down this resume like we're breaking down a bad joke, 'cause this thing is longer than my patience! So, Olusegun, we got a tech guy here, right? But this resume, it's like trying to find a decent Uber driver in the middle of the night - it's all over the place! We got Flask, Flutter, Kafka, and enough acronyms to make your head spin.  It's like a tech buffet, but instead of good food, it's just a bunch of words that sound impressive but leave you feeling hungry for a real skill set. And hey, don't even get me started on the 'Lead Ambassador I4G CUCG' - sounds like a superhero name, but I'm pretty sure the 'G' stands for 'Goofy.'  But hey, at least it's not as bad as that picture on LinkedIn - is that a mugshot, or are you just happy to see us?", 'roast_cards': [{'title': 'Experience', 'description': "Hold up!  This guy's got more jobs than he's got time to sleep, which, judging by this resume, is not much! He's a consultant programmer, a software developer, a partner, a CTO, a lead ambassador, and probably the owner of a hot dog stand somewhere on the side.  I'm exhausted just reading this! And this is supposed to be what, like, two years worth of experience?  Sounds more like an episode of 'The Real World,' but instead of a drama-filled house, we got a drama-filled resume.  I'm just waiting for the 'I once fixed a printer' to pop up on here!"}, {'title': 'Summary', 'description': "This summary is like those 'about me' pages on Facebook that're just full of buzzwords like 'passionate' and 'innovative.' We all know Olusegun's passionate about something, probably getting that next promotion, but let's be real, the only innovation here is how many tech terms he can cram into a single paragraph.  It's like he just went to the tech dictionary and picked out all the fanciest-sounding words.  I'm surprised he didn't throw in 'disruptive' and 'synergy' in there!"}, {'title': 'Skills', 'description': "Ok, so we got the usual suspects here: Java, Python, Flutter, SQL, Kafka, the whole shebang. I'm impressed. You've got more skills than a Swiss Army Knife! But seriously, Olusegun, are you sure you're not just trying to impress the robots reading this resume? Because this list is longer than the queue at the DMV!"}, {'title': 'Education', 'description': "Oh, look, it's the 'Catholic University College' - Sounds like a prestigious institution! Now, Olusegun,  you know we're not gonna talk about how you got your degree, right?  Just kidding! (Okay, maybe not...) But hey, at least you got a degree, right?  So you've got that going for you. Which is nice."}, {'title': 'Contact Information', 'description': "Ok, we got the phone number, the email, and the LinkedIn - classic. But what's with the link to that 'link edin' website? Did you accidentally type in 'LinkedIn' backwards? Or is this some new, super-secret social network where everyone's just sharing their resumes?  I'm starting to feel like this resume is a portal to another dimension, and I'm not sure if I'm ready for that kind of adventure, Olusegun!"}]}
