2024-09-05 16:34:26,525 - app - INFO - Analysis result: {'overall_feedba': "Yo! Olusesgun Tew Ogbade! I'm sorry, but this resume looks like it was designed by someone who just discovered the 'bold' button on Microsoft Word. It's like you took all the clichés from a tech resume and crammed 'em into one document. You're a 'passionate' software developer, huh? Passionate about writing 'impactful solutions' while sounding like a corporate robot.  And the 'knack for fintech'?  Dude, that's like saying you've got a 'knack for breathing.' Everyone's got a knack for fintech nowadays.  This resume needs a serious laugh injection, so let's break it down and sprinkle some Kevin Hart comedy on it, shall we?", 'feedback_cards': [{'title': 'Contact Information', 'description': "Hold up, hold up! Is 'Greater Accra Region' your address?  You're gonna have to be more specific, man. We need an actual address, not a whole region.  And that website link? 'https://www.link edin.com'? Did you copy and paste that from somewhere? My man, that's LinkedIn, not a new 'link edin' site.  And 'bishopte wogbade@gmail.com'? You sure that's not your old Hotmail address from 2002?"}, {'title': 'Summary', 'description': "Okay, I'm gonna need you to ditch that generic summary.  'Impactful solutions'? That's like saying you're a 'professional human being.' It's a given, man.  Instead of telling us you're 'passionate,' show us!  You built a chatbot that tells jokes?  You created a fintech app that lets people buy groceries with their thoughts?  Give me some real, tangible achievements, not generic buzzwords."}, {'title': 'Experience', 'description': "Alright, Olusesgun, you've got a lot of experience at different companies, that's for sure. But some of these descriptions are longer than my stand-up routines.  You're making me feel like I'm reading a novel, not a resume.  You know what would be funny? If you replaced all those numbers with funny metaphors. Instead of '70% reduction,' say 'it was like a sloth on a sugar rush!'  Get creative, man! This is your chance to shine."}, {'title': 'Skills', 'description': "You know what's missing from this skills section?  'Mastering the art of the witty one-liner.' 'Turning awkward situations into hilarious moments.' You know, the skills that actually make a difference! But seriously, it's a solid list.  I'm just messing with you, Olusesgun. You seem like you got the technical skills down."}, {'title': 'Education', 'description': "Catholic University College, Ghana.  I'm just picturing you sitting in class, trying to focus on algorithms while secretly thinking about your next stand-up routine.  You know what, Olusesgun?  You've got the brains to be a software developer AND a comedian.  Just make sure you're using those skills for good, not just for laughter."}]}
